WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:04.810
In Marseille, a French reader sees
an English headline on your site.

2
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.630
The story holds one English headline,
and the space has no other language.

3
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.920
General Translation lets
you connect your space

4
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.630
and translate stories with Sync and apply.

5
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.970
In Storyblok, add your target
languages to the space.

6
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.630
In the Dashboard, connect
the space with its ID,

7
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.730
its region and a personal access token.

8
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:32.090
Choose stories and target locales,
check Auto-enable supported fields,

9
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.230
and click Sync and apply.

10
00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.990
Review the Spanish, Japanese
and French drafts, publish them,

11
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.890
and fetch each language
with the language parameter.

12
00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:46.330
In Marseille, the published home page
now shows its headline in French.
